{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_7_level_st_07-04","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"st_07-04","title":"??:??:??","storyCode":"7-20","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_07-04.txt","sourceHash":"04b52dae612d17da0896c69192b1d7dd4df336b0c3880397d07c49bc329d1d7b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"陳與塔露拉分別之夜，科西切與魏彥吾的對峙。\n以及，攝政王與赦罪師對他們計畫的談論。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_23"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可以把她還給你，魏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"停！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不要動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噢。你這些強大的劊子手，真是讓我吃了很多苦頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我當然可以把她還給你......但她身上的銬環會引爆龍門半數城區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"魏，這是你曾經用來對付我的辦法，是你逼我離開龍門的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我們主客易位。我是客人，也是下毒的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"科西切。你害死了我的兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，不，魏。是你自己殺了自己的兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的角色並不重要。你兄弟的悲劇，也許出於一匹獨角獸的密令，一條真龍的震怒，但洩露消息的究竟是不是我，不，不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"重要的是，魏，唯一重要的事實是——你用你手中的赤霄劍，殺了自己的兄弟。親手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"赤霄，斬龍之劍。死在這劍下的是誰？血親，義親，至親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"斬龍之劍？你們這些人鑄造這把劍，不過用來同類相殘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說得太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好。我讓你選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"選吧。殺掉我搶回侄女，並因此毀掉這座城市；又或者允許我們平安離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要出劍。你知道後果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（牙齒研磨的聲音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放鬆些，魏。我已經允許你選了。如果你不選，那麼我，你，你的市民，還有這一對惹人憐愛的姐妹，都會一起死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在盤算什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"魏，魏......我瞭解你。我太瞭解你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你一直都有得選，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你寶貴的市民們，一旦聽說他們的生命被放在天平上，而另一邊是一條沒人知道姓名的幼龍，他們會怎麼想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我甚至沒有理由去傷害她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我既然疏忽到讓你再踏上這座城市，就沒理由再讓你離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小塔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會親手殺了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不必，不必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會死在正確的人手上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":"avg_npc_060","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，在我給她戴上銬環前，你可以救下她的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":"avg_npc_060","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你想著防範我，你想著戰勝我，打倒我，毀滅我......想看我要做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科西切","speakerId":"avg_npc_060","isRemote":false,"text":"魏，你其實害怕我，不是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她終於來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"親手殺了她吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"赦罪師，回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動的領袖，是否有結盟的價值？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"你很清楚的事情又何必問我，攝政王殿下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"一個沒有積累、沒有背景、沒有資本的青年，不可能憑一己之力拿下烏薩斯的重要城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"身為非感染者的統治者們，並不清楚蘊含在她行為裡的邏輯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"他們會一味恐懼，反應過激，嘗試透過破壞性的行為去解決混亂的局面——感染者帶來的混亂局面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們薩卡茲再清楚不過了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攝政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"至於她留在這裡的隊伍，你的看法是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有前景，殿下，正如你預見的那樣，並沒有什麼前景。他們並不是真正的軍隊，而我們需要的是足夠的暴力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攝政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"剪除他們不能削弱塔露拉的力量。我們缺少一個消滅她的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"她所帶來的局面、她攪動局面所需要的力量，都恰恰說明她並不是一個單純的感染者領袖，或是做好了準備去繼承皇冠的王儲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"她是個陰謀家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攝政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"即使如此，我也需要薩卡茲的全面回應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我有兩個好消息，第一是，對於“魔王”的搜查，已經有眉目了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島從未易手過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攝政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"來不及。我們必須立刻讓她開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"請不要發怒，允許我說出第二個吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"“她”已經準備好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_21"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_22"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攝政王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這才是我們應有的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攝政王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的正統王者，比任何不知名姓的繼承人都強。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
